  "description": "Zip through the urban jungle with the Vamoose City Commuter—our sleek, skinny-tire marvel that's a total game-changer! Perfect for commuting with your friends or cruising on paved paths, these skinnier tires mean business. It’s the Skinny you’ve been waiting for!\nGettin' Skinny with it!\nWith the same comfort level as our legendary sand and snow cruisers, the City Cruiser takes city commuting and touring up a notch. Equipped with nimble 26 x 2.4 tires and powered by a 500W Mid Drive motor, it delivers thrilling performance geared for city life. Plus, with a 48V 15Ah in-frame battery pumping out 720 watt-hours, you’re set for over 55 km of adventure. Ready to dominate the city streets with style and power? The City Cruiser is your ride!\nThis cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 48V 500W mid-drive\n\n• 48V 15Ah battery\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame\n\n• Integrated torque sensor\n\n• KD686 LCD colour display\n\n• 2-piston hydraulic brakes\n\n• Wired front and rear headlights and full fenders with S\n\n• Rear Rack\nSPECIFICATIONS PDF\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle-MID\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\n48v 500w\n\nRear Motor:\nN/A\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO Tourney 7-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nYes - right-hand twist\n\nDisplay:\n\nKD686 colour LCD\n\nBattery:\n48V 15 Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n48V 3A\n\nFront forks :\n\nBOXER 100 mm travel air fork\n\nRear Suspension:\nn/a\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nUnion Star hydraulic disc 2 piston, 180 mm rotor\n\nWheels:\n26\" X 2.4\" KENDA City\n\nPedals:\nWellgo\n\nSaddle:\nVelo VL-6221 Black\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nFront and rear racks\n\nFenders:\nAluminum\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n130 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n720\n\nMiles per charge:\n36\n\nKms per charge:\n58\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYes\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n153 x 26 x 84\n\nBox dimensions (in